From d6b698acd78c01d212bd5e16610bc4915b00507c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Feb 2024 17:48:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0653/1695] drivers: scmi-msg: support performance domains for
 DVFS

Implement some of the SCMI performance domain management messages
in scmi-msg drivers to support basic DVFS scenario.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 796f170735e0dbf5fc382b3918b4e483ad0dc674 drivers: scmi-msg: support performance domains for DVFS]
Change-Id: I48d958389017229b91c2fb48a8f6ddf55bd7ddd0
Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@linaro.org>
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/362289
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
---
